      "title": "Lifetime",
      "items": [
        "Registered as a process-lifetime singleton \u2014 BlobContainerClient is thread-safe and built at most once per instance.",
        "The Action<AzureStorageOptions> overload registers a plain singleton AzureStorageOptions instance, not IOptions<AzureStorageOptions> \u2014 the values never reach the service unless paired with services.Configure<AzureStorageOptions>(...)."
